cf:diagram
----------

cf:diagram (skills/diagram and scripts/diagram_*.rb) adapts material from
two MIT-licensed projects:

  diagram-design
  Copyright (c) 2025 Cathryn Lavery
  MIT License, https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design

  svg-diagram
  Copyright (c) 2026 bybit-exchange
  MIT License, https://github.com/bybit-exchange/svg-diagram

From diagram-design: the default editorial skin (palette, re-tuned for
contrast), the type roles, the node, arrow label, group, and legend
anatomy, the diagram type catalog and its type guidance, and the ideas
behind several lint checks. Its Python verifiers were ported to Ruby,
not copied. From svg-diagram: the ideas behind further lint checks.

Both upstream projects are distributed under the following terms.

